  - "Tr\u1EDDi h\xF4m nay \u0111\u1EB9p th\u1EADt... n\u1EAFng v\xE0ng, gi\xF3 m\xE1t."
  - "D\u1EA1o n\xE0y ng\u01B0\u1EDDi trong l\xE0ng c\u1EE9 b\xE0n t\xE1n m\xE3i v\u1EC1
    nh\u1EEFng v\u1EBFt n\u1EE9t m\xE0u t\xEDm ngo\xE0i kia."
  - "Kh\xF4ng bi\u1EBFt r\u1ED3i chuy\u1EC7n g\xEC s\u1EBD x\u1EA3y ra v\u1EDBi Fantasia
    n\u1EEFa..."
